---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import VenueCard from '../../components/VenueCard.astro';
import NewsletterBlock from '../../components/NewsletterBlock.astro';
import { routeSlug } from '../../lib/editorial';

const allVenues = await getCollection('venues');
const slugs = [
  'polperro-villas',
  'sanctuary-at-alba',
  'crittenden-villas',
  'port-phillip-estate',
  'cassis',
  'mantons-creek-estate',
  'woodman-estate',
  'cape-retreat',
];
const venues = slugs
  .map((slug) => allVenues.find((venue) => routeSlug(venue) === slug))
  .filter((venue): venue is NonNullable<typeof venue> => Boolean(venue));

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Stay', href: '/stay/' },
  { label: 'Villas' },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Villa Stays Mornington Peninsula · Peninsula Insider"
  description="The best villa stays on the Mornington Peninsula — vineyard villas, thermal-anchored suites, and architectural statements in the Red Hill corridor."
  section="stay"
  canonical="https://peninsulainsider.com.au/stay/villas/"
  modifiedTime="2026-05-08"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />
  <article class="article">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="article__title">Villa Stays on the Mornington Peninsula</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>The Peninsula's villa market is dominated by working-vineyard estates. The on-estate format lets you sleep where you drink, walk to the cellar door before day-trippers arrive, and eat dinner 200 metres from your bed. The variables that separate a worthwhile villa weekend from an expensive one are privacy, setting, on-estate access, and how well the format carries a full Friday-to-Sunday. The mistake is treating a villa as a hotel substitute — it isn't.</p>
        <p>Three patterns make the format a clear choice. The on-estate weekend: Polperro, Crittenden, and Mantons Creek all operate on the same principle — you sleep on the estate, walk to the cellar door, and never need to drive between your bed and your glass. The architectural set-piece: Port Phillip Estate, Polperro, and Cassis are three completely different interpretations of the adults-only vineyard villa within five kilometres of each other. The thermal-anchored stay: The Sanctuary at Alba, opened June 2025, is the first Peninsula property to combine a genuinely luxurious villa with all-day thermal bathing access.</p>
        <p>Note on Point Leo Estate: Point Leo does not operate on-estate accommodation. The Lon to Leo package partners with Lon Retreat in Sorrento. For on-estate stays near Laura and the sculpture park, Mantons Creek Estate is the closest vineyard-stay alternative.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--soft)">Last fact-verified: 7 May 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <section class="venues" id="rankings">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="venues__header">
        <div>
          <p class="label label--accent">Villa stays</p>
          <h2 class="venues__title">{venues.length} villa bases worth booking well ahead</h2>
          <p class="venues__sub">Vineyard estates, thermal-anchored villas, and architectural standalones — private formats for trips that want more than a room and a lobby.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/stay/winery-accommodation/" class="venues__link">Wine-country stays →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="venues__grid">{venues.map((venue) => <VenueCard venue={venue} hrefPrefix="/stay" />)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <NewsletterBlock />
</BaseLayout>
